cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
authors:
  - name: RakTikoo
title: "tonight: a ranked observing plan for one night at one site, from a CSV of targets"
version: 0.1.1
date-released: 2026-11-17
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/tonight"
repository-code: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/tonight"
abstract: >-
  Builds a ranked observing plan for one night at one site from a CSV of
  targets: each target's observable window (airmass under 2), minimum
  airmass, best time and Moon separation, with plain reasons for the
  targets that are not observable. Runs fully offline.
keywords:
  - astronomy
  - observing planning
  - astroplan
  - visibility
